---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy policy | rotpunkt.dev" description="Privacy information for visitors to rotpunkt.dev.">
	<SiteHeader />
	<main>
		<p class="eyebrow">Legal information</p>
		<h1>Privacy<br /><em>policy.</em></h1>

		<section><h2>1. Controller</h2><p>For details about the provider of this website, please see our <a href="/imprint">imprint</a>.</p></section>
		<section><h2>2. Visiting this website</h2><p>When you visit this website, the hosting provider may process technical data such as your IP address, date and time of access, requested page, browser type and operating system. This data is processed to deliver the website securely and reliably and to detect misuse. The legal basis is Article 6(1)(f) GDPR. Server logs are deleted according to the hosting provider’s retention policy unless they are needed to investigate a security incident.</p></section>
		<section><h2>3. Contact form</h2><p>If you contact us through the form, we process the information you provide, including your name, email address and message, to respond to your enquiry. The legal basis is Article 6(1)(b) GDPR where your enquiry relates to a potential contract, or Article 6(1)(f) GDPR for general enquiries. We retain the correspondence only as long as necessary to handle the enquiry and any applicable legal obligations.</p></section>
		<section><h2>4. Email delivery through AWS SES</h2><p>Contact-form messages are sent using Amazon Simple Email Service (AWS SES), provided by Amazon Web Services EMEA SARL, 38 Avenue John F. Kennedy, L-1855 Luxembourg. AWS processes the message and associated delivery data on our behalf. Depending on the hosting and AWS configuration, data may be processed outside the European Economic Area under the safeguards described in the AWS Data Processing Addendum and applicable standard contractual clauses.</p></section>
		<section><h2>5. Your rights</h2><p>Subject to the legal requirements, you have the right to request access to, rectification or erasure of your personal data, restriction of processing, data portability and to object to processing. Where processing is based on consent, you may withdraw that consent at any time. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</p></section>
		<section><h2>6. Updates</h2><p>We may update this privacy policy when the website, services or legal requirements change. The current version published on this page applies.</p></section>
		
	</main>
	<SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
	main { width: min(calc(100% - 3rem), 58rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 7rem 0 2rem; }
	.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); font: 700 .75rem/1.2 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h1, h2 { letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: 1; } h1 { margin: 0 0 5rem; font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem); } h1 em { color: var(--violet); font-style: normal; } h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); } section { padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } section p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; } section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; } section strong { color: var(--ink); } a { text-underline-offset: .2em; }
	aside { margin-top: 3rem; padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: .35rem solid var(--violet); } aside p { margin: .5rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
	@media (max-width: 720px) { main { width: min(calc(100% - 1.5rem), 58rem); padding-top: 4rem; } h1 { margin-bottom: 3rem; } }
</style>
